\subsection{Flickr8K}
Flickr8k \cite{hodosh2013framing} consists of 8,000 Flickr images. Each image has 5 captions written by humans and in average each caption has 124 words. Each caption has 5 different keywords. The goal is to generate image descriptions, where the model needs to predict the 5 captions that describe an image. The evaluation metric is the Mean-Reciprocal-Rank (MRR) score and the success rate is set to be at least 50\%.

